# Trivy IaC findings accepted by design. Each entry is justified; HIGH and
# CRITICAL findings are never ignored here. See docs/security.md.

# Node pools use UBUNTU_CONTAINERD instead of COS: required for SCTP on GKE
# Dataplane V2 (N2/NGAP) and for building/loading the gtp5g kernel module
# (COS LoadPin blocks out-of-tree modules).
GCP-0054

# The only firewall rule in this stack is an explicit DENY-all ingress
# baseline; the "large port range" heuristic does not apply to deny rules.
GCP-0074

# VPC flow logs are opt-in (variable enable_vpc_flow_logs) to keep the lab's
# logging cost low; enable them for investigations.
GCP-0029
GCP-0076
